    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Accenture plc is a for-profit public company headquartered in Dublin, L2, with ticker ACN and CIK 0001467373. Its website describes it as embracing change to create 360-degree value and shared success for clients, people, shareholders, partners and communities. It says that across industries and around the world it creates better experiences for people using emerging technologies and human ingenuity, and that together, anything can be reinvented.\n\nAccenture's AI material focuses on how people and AI work together, including redesigning work, accelerating skills, and reinventing HR to create measurable growth, stronger experiences, and lasting enterprise value in the Human & AI era. It says it explores AI tokenomics, AI ROI, and enterprise AI economics to connect spend with business value. It also discusses AI pushing power demand beyond grid limits, data center developers shifting to a power-first strategy, and cyber resilience in an AI-driven threat landscape.\n\nAccenture's website also says it helps the European Commission's Directorate-General for International Partnerships to scale AI across global operations.",
